This project's corner-point grid-processing algorithms were derived from
MRST — the MATLAB Reservoir Simulation Toolbox — specifically its
`processGRDECL.m` corner-point grid builder. We gratefully acknowledge
MRST and its authors.

    MRST is Copyright (C) SINTEF Digital and is licensed under the
    GNU General Public License v3.
    https://www.sintef.no/projectweb/mrst/

Routines from `processGRDECL.m` that this implementation is based on:

    findFaces        -> cpg2unstructured/unstructured.py
                        (find_i_faces / find_j_faces / find_k_faces,
                         build_topology)
    findFaults       -> cpg2unstructured/unstructured.py
                        (_faulted_pillar_mask_i/j/k)
    findConnections  -> cpg2unstructured/_fault_connections.py
    computeFaceGeometry,
    intersection     -> cpg2unstructured/_fault_geometry.py
    processPINCH     -> pinch detection + UnstructuredGrid.nnc
    SplitDisconnected,
    removeCells      -> UnstructuredGrid.component / UnstructuredGrid.split()
